    "Soup"
  ],
  "cuisines": [
    "American"
  ],
  "regions": [
    "American"
  ],
  "breadcrumbs": [],
  "keywords": [],
  "ingredients": [
    "2 tablespoons butter",
    "1 onion, finely diced",
    "salt to taste",
    "4 cups chicken broth",
    "2 cups water",
    "2 pounds fresh asparagus, trimmed and cut into 1-inch pieces",
    "1 pinch cayenne pepper, or to taste",
    "freshly ground black pepper to taste",
    "1 pinch ground nutmeg",
    "0.5 cup heavy whipping cream",
    "0.25 cup heavy whipping cream",
    "1 tablespoon freshly grated Parmigiano-Reggiano cheese",
    "1 teaspoon lemon zest",
    "1 pinch cayenne pepper"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/J_BB91tSsoayKXkouRgsPj_D6GI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-231810-chef-johns-cream-of-asparagus-soup-VAT-step-01-a51a916cc3fe433baabc4206891eff1d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/231810/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "To make the asparagus soup: Melt butter in a soup pot over medium heat. Add minced onion and salt; cook and stir until onion is soft and golden, about 10 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/J_AEP9kmKARdWjy6kPRnd-OOinU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-231810-chef-johns-cream-of-asparagus-soup-VAT-step-02-ecf1313166844bdcacb08d7bf35f6638.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/231810/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour chicken broth and water into the pot. Bring to a boil, reduce heat to medium, and simmer 15 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/4gPNcxtpKoH3Z0hE149SI9PRSWM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-231810-chef-johns-cream-of-asparagus-soup-VAT-step-03-1a4032f742684edf9db0e6fabd105afa.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/231810/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Carefully add asparagus pieces into simmering broth. Cook, stirring occasionally until asparagus is just tender and still bright green, 5 to 10 minutes. Remove from heat.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/X9EHuVn6Kzi3iENDYwM4lvxpKdw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-231810-chef-johns-cream-of-asparagus-soup-VAT-step-04-9c104019921945b0ac387cc70e8f4e24.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/231810/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Use an immersion blender to blend soup until smooth, about 3 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/8kRSPVmqnisrnLWHViHFczZRO3g=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-231810-chef-johns-cream-of-asparagus-soup-VAT-step-05-092eaca0966947078c11d2453ba74362.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/231810/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Turn heat to low. Season with cayenne pepper, black pepper, and nutmeg. Adjust salt to taste. Whisk 1/2 cup cream into soup.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/vHg2oirLgdYu2r_DDAlr43I-qGE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-231810-chef-johns-cream-of-asparagus-soup-VAT-step-06-79a7297ad2c54bfca3bc5df512b4dd3c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/231810/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "If you want to make a cream topping for garnishing: Place 1/4 cup cream, Parmigiano-Reggiano cheese, and lemon zest in a small bowl. Whisk until frothy and slightly thickened, about 1 minute.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/EMMvHCOZbDjEs-7kZRTKz6WXduQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-231810-chef-johns-cream-of-asparagus-soup-VAT-step-07-806b7196b5f14e4d97ace2bf5d7301ea.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/231810/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Ladle soup into bowls. Drizzle a spoonful of prepared cream on top of each serving and swirl to form a random design.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/kZ4MM1YNjiX4nKSmGmvGZbYpkVA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-231810-chef-johns-cream-of-asparagus-soup-VAT-step-08-1f37c6f141e24f8ca4e96f0f8923cc3f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/231810/step_08.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sprinkle with a pinch of lemon zest and cayenne pepper, if desired.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/wZeIvOH-I9vr8q-LwRiUxQsPJ04=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-231810-chef-johns-cream-of-asparagus-soup-VAT-step-09-8169181a6c1044dd8ba157069146f4f6.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/231810/step_09.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/5km8abIXO6fAVxnC4GzFtBOP8XY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-231810-chef-johns-cream-of-asparagus-soup-VAT-4x3-b7a03655bb9946a9a5ee384bedb805ca.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/231810/step_10.webp"
    }
  ],
